  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROMOVE-Agribiz. Improving rural competetiveness in Nampula and Zamb&#xe9;zia provinces</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action will aim at improving small producers&apos; productivity and resilience, enhance the provision of support services, including financial and rural extension services, as well as, foster commercial partnerships with enterprises and increase the availability of commercial operational services along selected value chains.</narrative>
